---
title: "repay_flash_loan (Scallop Sui Lending Protocol)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_version: assert_current_version(version)
    q_version --> q_emit: emit RepayFlashLoanV2Event
    q_emit --> q_calc_required: total_required = flash_loan_amount + flash_loan_fee
    q_calc_required --> q_check_overpay: coin_value > total_required
    q_check_overpay --> q_refund: overpaid
    q_check_overpay --> q_repay: exact or underpaid
    q_refund --> q_repay: split and transfer remaining to sender
    q_repay --> [*]: market::repay_flash_loan(market, coin, loan)

    note right of q_calc_required
        INV-001: repayment must cover loan_amount + fee
        INV-002: FlashLoan hot potato consumed, enforcing same-transaction repayment
        INV-003: overpayment is refunded to sender
    end note

    note right of q_repay
        INV-004: market::repay_flash_loan validates coin covers loan + fee
        INV-005: fee goes to protocol revenue
    end note
